        "Content": "•\tBeautifully presented three-bedroom semi-detached residence extending to approximately 134 sqm (1,442 sq.ft.) \r\n•\tAdditional 11.43 sqm Shomera, fully insulated and floored with electric heating, kitchenette and window \r\n•\tBright and spacious accommodation throughout \r\n•\tLarge open-plan living and dining area with modern contemporary fully integrated kitchen \r\n•\tThree well-proportioned double bedrooms \r\n•\tUtility room and guest W.C. \r\n•\tSunny south-facing rear garden with excellent natural light \r\n•\tVersatile Seomra, ideal for a home office, studio, gym or hobby space \r\n•\tFurther potential to extend, subject to planning permission, including the remaining garage area \r\n•\tMature and highly regarded Glendoher location, close to excellent schools, amenities, Marlay Park, Dublin Bus routes and the M50 motorway"
